  <item>
    <title>020 听我说谢谢你，神奇的身体保护机制</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b9d2e505a90dfd0d273f1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b9d2e505a90dfd0d273f1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Feb 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们的身体是个精密又神奇的系统，无时无刻不在周全地保护着我们，这期聊聊身体保护我们的各种方式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏋️ 时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">00:01:49</a> 骨骼弹性和关节灵活度降低了摔跤的伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">00:05:07</a> 30岁之后，每十年会流失3%-5%的肌肉量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">00:06:45</a> 谢谢脂肪缓冲，但铁管还是戳进了大腿 &gt;&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a> “平台期”原来是身体怕我死掉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">00:10:38</a> 腰围直接反应了腹部脂肪的堆积情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">00:11:43</a> 谢谢神经系统的迅雷不及掩耳盗铃二响叮当！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">00:14:19</a> 恐怖故事，牛仔裤布条在大腿里呆了半年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">00:17:18</a> 为什么受伤的当下感受不到痛感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">00:22:38</a> “解离”是大脑带我逃离极端痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">00:25:52</a> 难受的时候哭出来，没关系～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">00:27:32</a> 冷知识，人不可能憋气憋死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">00:29:04</a> 就离谱，小红书网友能闻见病毒的味道？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">00:31:08</a> 我们的神奇体质：大腿牵动耳根，恐惧激活舌头</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎬 “解离女性主义”英剧：</span></strong><span>《伦敦生活》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM：</span></strong><span>《身体都知道》-田馥甄</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66cc81ab56bfd3907a3c6c56/ljH2HFU9LVFKZ5m4enBKRFW43gGz.m4a" length="51272835" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:21</itunes:duration>
