  <item>
    <title>019 掌握肢体语言，破解社交密码</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a8992ed74435e4a30dbd7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a8992ed74435e4a30dbd7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2025 12:07:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何掌握社交密码？学会这些小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过了解肢体语言和声音特征，我们可以在社交场合中更好地表达自己，避免传达错误的信号。无论你是内向还是外向，无论是工作还是生活，都能通过这些实用的建议，提升自己的社交技能，找到适合自己的社交方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤝时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">00:02:13</a>: 中间性格（ambiverts）：非i非e，又i又e</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">00:03:55</a>: 了解自己的性格特性和能量来源：在人际交往中保持真诚和高效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a>: 真实自我表达：不是“改变自己”或“变得外向”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">00:09:06</a>: 你留意过你的“初始/默认表情”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">00:13:53</a>: 主动向别人表达喜欢的人也会同样被喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">00:15:04</a>: 提高人缘的小妙招：“我正好想起你了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">00:17:26</a>: 面对负面情绪的小妙招：标记情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">00:19:08</a>: 手势在沟通和表达中的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">00:22:25</a>: 提升个人魅力的关键：亲和力和专业能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">00:23:13</a>: “尖塔手”：《叶惠美》？deepseek？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">00:29:04</a>: 对话中保持60%～70%的眼神交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">00:31:35</a>: 提升亲和力的5个小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">00:34:18</a>: 增强说服力的“黑魔法”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">00:39:54</a>: 个人形象塑造的5个小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>📺视频分析：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1r2qPYmEif/?buvid=Z0486E006E38D570422288A2208647A442CA&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=6C3c3%2Bl2NJcPM8wmHsS51Q%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=168&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=4C0715BD-06C9-4ECD-BEAE-2EA1DD26B4B6&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_source=weixin&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=main.my-history-search-result.option-more.0&amp;timestamp=1736130663&amp;unique_k=LfZlt8S&amp;up_id=252508&amp;vd_source=855a23c1be101c2801c3203176faf9e3" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1r2qPYmEif/?buvid=Z0486E006E38D570422288A2208647A442CA&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=6C3c3%2Bl2NJcPM8wmHsS51Q%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=168&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=4C0715BD-06C9-4ECD-BEAE-2EA1DD26B4B6&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_source=weixin&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=main.my-history-search-result.option-more.0&amp;timestamp=1736130663&amp;unique_k=LfZlt8S&amp;up_id=252508&amp;vd_source=855a23c1be101c2801c3203176faf9e3"><span>肢体语言分享</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：《晴天》-周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>需要大家评评理的《叶惠美》封面：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjChYrdJQMU8d3N_-TUGCJY7qIQB.png"></figure>]]></description>
