  <item>
    <title>018 太好了是护肤品配方师！我们有救了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678c75289420ede9d110f318</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678c75289420ede9d110f318</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在容易干燥敏感的大冬天，我们邀请了国内某头部化妆品公司的配方师来和我们一起聊聊护肤！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👧 本期嘉宾</span></strong><span>：前进（护肤品配方师）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💄 时间戳</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">00:01:36</a> “生化环材”是配方师的对口专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">00:05:49</a> 活性物成分是护肤品的精华所在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">00:13:41</a> 成分小课堂之“美白”：烟酰胺、熊果苷…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">00:15:32</a> 成分小课堂之“抗老”：A醇、胜肽、玻色因…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">00:19:18</a> 成分小课堂之“保湿”：甘油、玻尿酸、泛醇…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">00:21:36</a> 成分小课堂之“缩毛孔”：清洁、刷酸…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">00:28:45</a> “二次清洁”是必要步骤还是营销手段？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">00:32:30</a> 展开说说“早C晚A”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">00:35:51</a> 面膜：一天一敷没必要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">00:38:20</a> 爽肤水：主打肤感和打开皮肤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">00:39:23</a> 精华：一分钱一分货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">00:41:31</a> 眼霜：脆弱的皮肤需要特别呵护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">00:42:29</a> 洗面奶：非驻留型产品要那么贵干啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">00:44:00</a> 不要迷信“美修全绿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2952">00:49:12</a> 我们的色斑和细纹还有救吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM</span></strong><span>：《看我72变》- 蔡依林</span></p>]]></description>
