  <item>
    <title>017 看看我们的电子2024都去哪儿啦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677a5c0d1e823e72d357c18d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677a5c0d1e823e72d357c18d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 10:26:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📖辞旧迎新，来一起回顾下我们的电子2024都去哪儿啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>💚</span><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">00:01:54</a>：年度歌手和专辑：苏打绿《你在烦恼什么》、Charli XCX《brat》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">00:07:02</a>：年度歌曲：《A&amp;W》Lana Del Rey、《河流》蛙池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">00:13:16</a>：我们2024年的豆瓣五星电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">00:17:42</a>：跨越时空的《哈利波特》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">00:20:18</a>：B站年度UP主：食贫道、芳芳的快乐生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">00:22:17</a>：在小红书熬的最深的夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">00:24:39</a>：年度挚爱外卖商品“菠菜50g”？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a>：阿普的外卖备注字字珠玑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">00:28:44</a>：省钱小妙招：对着手机喊穷！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">00:29:55</a>：我们在淘宝的消费都被其它平台分走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">00:35:11</a>：飞行mbti P人和J人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">00:39:49</a>：过去一年在小宇宙我们听了谁，谁又听了我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">00:43:24</a>：2024年的关键词：“劳有所得”、“关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">00:48:19</a>：2024年最重要的一个习得/变化：“早点开始，慢慢进行”、“对工作祛魅”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">00:53:33</a>：2024年最大的遗憾：“没有每周都和家人打电话”、“没能去到的瑞士”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3313">00:55:13</a>：2024年新养成的习惯：“写周报”、“背单词”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">01:00:42</a>：2025年对自己的一个期待：“放下”、“慎独”</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁本期节目有抽奖哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会在评论区抽取一份“年度回忆”，为ta的分享者送上礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家对ohno!的支持，2025年ohno!会继续陪伴和支持你！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《CHIHIRO》-Billie Eilish</span></p>]]></description>
