  <item>
    <title>016 职场安陵容，每次忍气吞声都是吞下的苦杏仁！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6770f10e1e823e72d395dbfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6770f10e1e823e72d395dbfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🙅🏼 </span></strong><span>哦莫，我俩在这一期里双双被确诊为“职场安陵容”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享过各自的“安陵容时刻”和解决方式后，我们希望能在新的一年里摆脱“职场安陵容”的称号。如果你也有类似的“安陵容时刻”，请一起加入我们的改变计划，拒绝吞下一颗颗名为“忍气吞声”和“自我怀疑”的苦杏仁！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💅🏼 时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">00:01:17</a> “职场安陵容”们快来对号入座啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">00:03:01</a> 特征1. 心思细腻，别人一句话琢磨很久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">00:04:40</a> 特征2. 在意别人看法，“宝鹃，你猜别人是不是在背后笑话我”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">00:05:29</a> 特征3. 讨好皇上甄嬛、讨好老板同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">00:06:01</a> 特征4. 总是在跟别人做对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">00:08:22</a> 特征5. 自卑，“原是我不配～”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">00:09:32</a> 特征6. 盯住错误，不肯与自己和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">00:11:03</a> 脱离学生身份后，我仿佛失去了人生目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">00:17:53</a> 老板的反馈不应该成为我对自己的唯一评价体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">00:21:07</a> 工作边界缺失让我患上“朋友圈恐惧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">00:23:15</a> 好委屈，为什么工作中我总是在寻求理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">00:29:44</a> 摆脱“职场安陵容”，不要把工作当成天大的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">00:35:03</a> “弱者报复，强者原谅，智者忽略”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">00:37:40</a> “ego小”的真正要义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">00:39:58</a> 听听AI对于摆脱“职场安陵容”的真知灼见</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llE7WIMpRJdbp-zlOiO_lVSdh62Y.m4a" length="65012609" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-fmtwcvAkMSQsxeGVhz250GZr3.jpg"/>
