data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/398251"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《剪刀手爱德华》</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/stnv37gf9fye063/f00203rauag.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/stnv37gf9fye063/f00203rauag.html"><span>腾讯视频</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/420661" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/420661"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《小森林冬春篇》</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/1o7ou00t80apgko/w0018fcfqfv.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/1o7ou00t80apgko/w0018fcfqfv.html"><span>腾讯视频</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/557039" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/557039"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《查理和巧克力工厂》</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/rzunc9o5l5h1kzj/o0022l66e0m.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/rzunc9o5l5h1kzj/o0022l66e0m.html"><span>腾讯视频</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep311477?theme=movie&amp;spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep311477?theme=movie&amp;spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>Bilibili</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/391208" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/391208"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《蜗牛回忆录》</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/886856" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/886856"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《闪灵》</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/di25h17qqkgj08p/u0022mdu41x.html" data-url="https://v.qq.com/x/cover/di25h17qqkgj08p/u0022mdu41x.html"><span>腾讯视频</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/426157" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/426157"><span>iKanBot</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><