  <item>
    <title>014 别急～谁还没点儿拖延症了？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6753ff0bbdb9877a97fec777</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6753ff0bbdb9877a97fec777</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>原来不管是P人Zoe还是J人阿普，都会有拖延症！</span></p><span></span><p><span>拖延症不是什么“大病”，但有时候真的又耽误事儿又令人焦虑。这期我们分享了拖延症的定义&amp;类型、生理成因、还有9个亲测超有效的拖延症应对锦囊！超多干货，希望能帮大家更好地看待和应对拖延症。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而且从另一个角度来看，拖延症也有它的意义，能提醒我们想清楚自己真正想要/不想要的东西，而且有的事儿拖着拖着就能拖没了（嘘🤫...</span></p><span></span><p><span>又快又好完成任务也好，适度拖延从容不迫也好，归根结底还是希望我们都能有节奏、不焦虑地做好事情！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏃 时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:00:51</a> 不稀奇，P人和J人都可能有拖延症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">00:05:04</a> 拖延症是在能预料后果有害的情况下，仍然推迟需要做的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">00:06:07</a> 拖延不只关乎生产力，还是种情绪调节问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">00:08:12</a> 不停拖拖拖让我好焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">00:11:15</a> 患上拖延症原来是因为我被大脑操控了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">00:14:11</a> 拖延者是在用想象中的自己看当下的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">00:16:55</a> 锦囊1：放弃幻想，立即行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">00:20:44</a> 锦囊2：从简单任务开始，建立触发器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">00:22:52</a> 锦囊3：培养习惯，内心驱动力不可轻信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> 锦囊4：放低预期，一口吃不成个胖子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">00:25:47</a> 锦囊5：学习外卖小哥，觉察和利用碎片化时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">00:28:16</a> 锦囊6：用“不拖延的好处”诱惑自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">00:31:32</a> 锦囊7：与人性的弱点做做对抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">00:32:44</a> 锦囊8：Fake it till you make it 💪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">00:33:55</a> 锦囊9：找个搭子，小鞭子互相抽起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">00:34:54</a> 话说回来，拖延症也有益处</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 </span><strong><span>视频分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13U411F7FY/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=855a23c1be101c2801c3203176faf9e3" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13U411F7FY/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=855a23c1be101c2801c3203176faf9e3"><span>拖延症如何干废现实自己?自我整合度高的人不会焦虑抑郁拖延</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《拖延症》- 舵Diverseddie</span></p><span></span><p><span>《拖延症2020》- 直火帮Feezy</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loQNBOGw7dDXDQ19aoum0XRYtjMh.m4a" length="56768360" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-fmtwcvAkMSQsxeGVhz250GZr3.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>013 我们喜欢的“好东西”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c5823c3b2a2f334d263a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674c5823c3b2a2f334d263a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 12:46:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>电影《好东西》以其独特的女性视角和讲述方式，获得了正式上映前就极高的热度和豆瓣9.1的开分记录。影片通过三个不同人生阶段女性的故事，探讨了一些女性主义和社会议题。风格新鲜、表达轻松，对一些敏感话题也处理得十分细腻，不落俗套，引发了我们许多的思考和共鸣，也由此想到了很多其它的“好东西”们希望可以和你们一起分享～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥁</span><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a>：三位处于不同阶段的女性演绎出一种“百家争鸣”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">00:03:58</a>：恋爱脑也可以是爱情与自我价值的辩证探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">00:05:51</a>：毫无爹味，满是玩味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">00:07:21</a>：谁说不能做一个“平庸”的观众？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">00:08:55</a>：在王铁梅和李红身上获得了“反向”配得感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">00:12:01</a>：王铁梅和小叶让我看到不一样的女性友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">00:14:55</a>：接受自己的脆弱和无能也很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">00:16:16</a>：月经可以拿到台面上讲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">00:20:39</a>：石头姐和绿巨人，实在让我有些接受无能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">00:22:51</a>：30岁真的是个门槛吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">00:26:22</a>：“老娘与海”点燃女性的火光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">00:28:11</a>：中年女性对性、自我、身体的探索和表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">00:29:28</a>：《泰坦尼克号》中的女性主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">00:31:34</a>：凯特·温斯莱特，不一样的“女神”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">00:33:19</a>：余秀华的残缺、阴影、力量和美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">00:34:58</a>：阴道不应该被“藏起来”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">00:38:12</a>：站上舞台重新看待作为女性的我</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎬 我们提到的作品：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《好东西》</span></strong><span>：院线热映中</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《出走的决心》</span></strong><span>：腾讯视频/Bilibili</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/825250" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/825250"><strong><span>可怜的东西</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《29+1》</span></strong><span>：腾讯视频/Bilibili</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《泳者之心》</span></strong><span>：腾讯视频/Bilibili</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/824334" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/824334"><strong><span>奈德</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/692062" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/692062"><strong><span>祝你好运，里奥·格兰德</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>凯特·温斯莱特：《泰坦尼克号》、《暖暖内含光》、《革命之路》、《身为人母》、《东城梦魇》</span></strong><span>（以上腾讯视频/Bilibili都可以看），</span><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/398862" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/398862"><strong><span>朗读者</span></strong></a><strong><span>》，《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/601916" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/601916"><strong><span>菊石</span></strong></a><strong><span>》，《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/884023" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/884023"><strong><span>李</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《万吨月色》</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/630737" data-url="https://v.ikanbot.com/play/630737"><strong><span>阴道独白</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0vm6QLAttsSuZw8d8KQop2BMuU.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《蜜湖》-简约情人</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loSv--L3AOEeGRA0GLmVee6au4-7.m4a" length="60306201" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:34</itunes:duration>
