  <item>
    <title>012 疲惫清零，牛马快充攻略大放送～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674153c111045e78e539dda2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674153c111045e78e539dda2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🥱 这周阿普和Zoe都在疯狂出差加班，严重缺觉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个快节奏的世界里，我们常常忽视了休息的重要性。本期节目我们将深入探讨如何通过科学的方法和实用的技巧来提高休息效率和质量，帮助你在忙碌的生活中找到平衡、恢复活力。祝大家都能睡个好觉～</span></p><span></span><p><span>😴 时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 我们996，火龙果007？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 睡眠在修复我们的DNA损伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 睡眠不足=醉了😵💫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 睡得越久不等于休息越好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 睡不着没关系，闭目养神也能得到休息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 睡眠的4个阶段：浅睡眠、轻睡眠、深度睡眠、快速眼动期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> 设一个90分钟倍数的闹钟，更舒服地醒来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 健康高效的睡眠是啥样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 如何改善洗澡拖延症：有点抽象但有用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 短暂小憩也很有用：NSDR非睡眠深度休息法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 泡脚助眠的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 成大事者不睡觉？懂王一天只睡3小时？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 找到适合自己的个性化休息方式</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrKSaTNo9I4zubuWlfVR4YKia89x.m4a" length="44359482" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:35</itunes:duration>
