  <item>
    <title>010 旷野还是轨道？已婚已育的我可以都要！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672f6cd543dc3a4387472c70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672f6cd543dc3a4387472c70</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Nov 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👏 本期节目是一场人生朋友局，邀请到了我们的好朋友——小吴和姥爷</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小吴：婚龄2.5年，怀孕7个月，最近正忙着面试月嫂、为即将到来的宝宝置办各种必备用品</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>姥爷：婚龄2年，宝宝b猪11个月，刚刚跳槽到一家新公司，工作加班之余尽力给到b猪更多陪伴</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊了聊婚育的话题，“宝妈组”给我们“单身组”带来了很多新鲜的见闻，打破了我们刻板印象中的夫妻关系和育儿理念</span></p><span></span><p><span>令人开心的是，处于不同阶段的我们四人，都很满意自己当下的生活状态，正在人生的旷野里筑建轨道、在轨道之中畅想旷野</span></p><span></span><p><span>👶 时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">00:04:51</a> 怀孕是顺其自然又意料之外的发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">00:06:24</a> 恐婚不恐恋，是当代单身族的常态吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a> 《人生第一次》劝退我的生娃念头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">00:12:35</a> 20%-30%的妈妈经历过产后抑郁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">00:17:24</a> 主动磨合，是理工男的浪漫呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">00:20:15</a> J人和P人的育儿理念真的差异很大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">00:24:57</a> 单身的幸福就是一个人占据一整片阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">00:25:45</a> 有些时刻，我希望自己不是单身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">00:27:53</a> 一直单身的遗憾是缺失了某些体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">00:30:07</a> 怀孕之后，我开始回溯自己的成长历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">00:35:16</a> 一个不正确的问题：女性如何平衡家庭和事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">00:41:58</a> 太酷了吧，婚后有娃还能AA？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">00:43:27</a> 我是怎么决定不喂母乳的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">00:47:19</a> 面试了二三十个月嫂，还没人能入法眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">00:48:50</a> 广东月嫂怎么那么爱做猪脚姜啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">00:51:20</a> 离谱！别对大龄单身女性恶意太大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3179">00:52:59</a> 格局打开，亲密关系不止一种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">00:55:40</a> 智商税：各式各样的宝宝睡枕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3506">00:58:26</a> 待产妈妈提前准备了些什么好物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">01:01:01</a> 小心避雷：带背垫的餐椅、婴儿提篮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3914">01:05:14</a> 重来一次？不用啦，一切都是最好的安排</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>魏如萱《变形金刚》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loM33cLsMqAe6WCok0EuL6nWIKp6.m4a" length="98166264" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:40</itunes:duration>
