  <item>
    <title>007 跟外貌焦虑和解，夺回身体自主权</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6714a52c0d2f24f28967be07</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6714a52c0d2f24f28967be07</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿普、田田、Zoe在这一期深入讨论了“困扰东亚女人一生的难题”——外貌焦虑。原来不管是胖、是瘦、是高、是矮，都会焦虑啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们分享了各自的“血泪经验”：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿普在生活被体重的乌云笼罩二十多年后，终于找到了自己的和解曲线</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>田田最大的焦虑是身高，但被工作经历和亲密关系治愈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Zoe在攀岩馆看到女孩子们凭上肢力量吊在岩壁上飞荡，感受到了力量的美……</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>透过这期节目，我们想和你分享：</span><strong><span>请一定要真诚善意地对待自己和他人，不要被外界的审美标准裹挟，发现自己的美！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>✍️时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 哎一古，双十一引出了我的外貌焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> “别人家的小孩”因为胖而自卑了很多很多年☹️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 青春期发胖，我想成为纸片人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 小个子能不能找得到对象啊？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 举手！1米7+的女生才不好找对象呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 不是凡尔赛，婚后的菌群交换让我恢复正常体重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 营养科专家帮我5个月减重28斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 食物短缺的恐慌让我迅速发胖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 增重是我善待自己的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 减重成功后我开始暴饮暴食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 小周：1米52和1米81四舍五入都是2米啊～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 辩证看待多元审美的舆论导向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 攀岩馆里的姐姐好美好帅🤩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 焦虑来源于对问题定义不够清晰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 珂学教给我们可以微do🫧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 以貌取人很正常，重要的是真诚和善意</span></p>]]></description>
